{
  "id": "E02",
  "title": "零複製串流",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1) 0%, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05) 100%); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 48px; border-radius: 8px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading);\">在 Photon 中利用 Bun 的原生 <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;\">Bun.file()</code> API 來提供二進位資料，而無需在 JavaScript heap 中進行中間緩衝。這種零複製方法為提供大型檔案（如影片、圖片和文件）提供了<strong>卓越的效能</strong>。</p></div><h2>為什麼需要零複製？</h2><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px; margin: 24px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0 0 20px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">傳統的 Node.js 檔案提供方法透過 JavaScript streams 緩衝資料，導致：</p><ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 16px;\"><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; padding: 16px; background-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #EF4444; border-radius: 6px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #EF4444; color: white; border-radius: 50%; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\">1</span><span style=\"flex: 1; color: var(--text-main); line-height: 1.6;\">JavaScript 和原生程式碼之間多次上下文切換</span></li><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; padding: 16px; background-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #EF4444; border-radius: 6px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #EF4444; color: white; border-radius: 50%; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\">2</span><span style=\"flex: 1; color: var(--text-main); line-height: 1.6;\">在 V8 heap 中為檔案區塊分配記憶體</span></li><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; padding: 16px; background-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #EF4444; border-radius: 6px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #EF4444; color: white; border-radius: 50%; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\">3</span><span style=\"flex: 1; color: var(--text-main); line-height: 1.6;\">大型檔案效能下降</span></li></ul><div style=\"margin-top: 24px; padding: 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15) 0%, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05) 100%); border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.3);\"><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-heading); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">Bun 的 <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.2); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;\">Bun.file()</code> 直接將檔案描述符傳遞給優化的 C++ 伺服器，無論檔案大小如何，結果都是 <strong style=\"color: #FFB800;\">0MB 的記憶體壓力</strong>。</p></div></div><h2>基本檔案提供</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">提供檔案的最簡單方式：</p><pre><code>import { Photon } from '@gravito/photon'\n\nconst app = new Photon()\n\napp.get('/video/:id', async (c) => {\n  const id = c.req.param('id')\n  const file = Bun.file(`./assets/${id}.mp4`)\n  \n  // 檢查檔案是否存在\n  if (!(await file.exists())) {\n    return c.text('File not found', 404)\n  }\n  \n  // 直接返回檔案（零複製）\n  return new Response(file, {\n    headers: {\n      'Content-Type': 'video/mp4'\n    }\n  })\n})</code></pre><h2>自動 Content-Type 檢測</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">Bun 會根據副檔名自動檢測 MIME 類型：</p><pre><code>app.get('/image/:filename', async (c) => {\n  const filename = c.req.param('filename')\n  const file = Bun.file(`./public/images/${filename}`)\n  \n  if (await file.exists()) {\n    // Content-Type 會根據副檔名自動設定\n    return new Response(file)\n  }\n  \n  return c.text('Not found', 404)\n})</code></pre><h2>自訂標頭</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">為快取、下載提示等添加自訂標頭：</p><pre><code>app.get('/download/:filename', async (c) => {\n  const filename = c.req.param('filename')\n  const file = Bun.file(`./downloads/${filename}`)\n  \n  if (await file.exists()) {\n    return new Response(file, {\n      headers: {\n        'Content-Type': file.type || 'application/octet-stream',\n        'Content-Disposition': `attachment; filename=\"${filename}\"`,\n        'Cache-Control': 'public, max-age=3600'\n      }\n    })\n  }\n  \n  return c.text('Not found', 404)\n})</code></pre><h2>Range 請求（影片串流）</h2><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 20px; margin: 24px 0; border-radius: 6px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">影片串流支援</p><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7;\">Bun 自動處理 HTTP Range 請求以進行影片串流，實現無縫搜尋和播放。</p></div><pre><code>app.get('/stream/:id', async (c) => {\n  const id = c.req.param('id')\n  const file = Bun.file(`./videos/${id}.mp4`)\n  \n  if (await file.exists()) {\n    // Bun 自動處理 Range 標頭以進行影片搜尋\n    return new Response(file, {\n      headers: {\n        'Content-Type': 'video/mp4',\n        'Accept-Ranges': 'bytes',\n        'Content-Length': file.size.toString()\n      }\n    })\n  }\n  \n  return c.text('Not found', 404)\n})</code></pre><h2>安全性：路徑驗證</h2><div style=\"background-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #EF4444; padding: 20px; margin: 24px 0; border-radius: 6px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">安全警告</p><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7;\">始終驗證檔案路徑以防止目錄遍歷攻擊。</p></div><pre><code>app.get('/uploads/:filename', async (c) => {\n  const filename = c.req.param('filename')\n  \n  // 防止目錄遍歷\n  if (!filename || filename.includes('..') || filename.includes('/')) {\n    return c.text('Forbidden', 403)\n  }\n  \n  // 清理檔名\n  const sanitized = filename.replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9._-]/g, '')\n  const file = Bun.file(`./uploads/${sanitized}`)\n  \n  if (await file.exists()) {\n    return new Response(file)\n  }\n  \n  return c.text('Not found', 404)\n})</code></pre><h2>檔案元資料</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">在提供檔案前存取檔案元資料：</p><pre><code>app.get('/file-info/:filename', async (c) => {\n  const filename = c.req.param('filename')\n  const file = Bun.file(`./files/${filename}`)\n  \n  if (await file.exists()) {\n    const stats = await file.stat()\n    \n    return c.json({\n      name: filename,\n      size: stats.size,\n      type: file.type,\n      lastModified: stats.lastModified\n    })\n  }\n  \n  return c.text('Not found', 404)\n})</code></pre><h2>條件請求（ETag）</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">使用 ETag 實作高效快取：</p><pre><code>app.get('/asset/:filename', async (c) => {\n  const filename = c.req.param('filename')\n  const file = Bun.file(`./assets/${filename}`)\n  \n  if (await file.exists()) {\n    const stats = await file.stat()\n    const etag = `\"${stats.lastModified}-${stats.size}\"`\n    \n    // 檢查 If-None-Match 標頭\n    if (c.req.header('If-None-Match') === etag) {\n      return new Response(null, { status: 304 })\n    }\n    \n    return new Response(file, {\n      headers: {\n        'ETag': etag,\n        'Cache-Control': 'public, max-age=31536000'\n      }\n    })\n  }\n  \n  return c.text('Not found', 404)\n})</code></pre><h2>效能比較</h2><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; margin: 32px 0;\"><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #EF4444; opacity: 0.8;\"></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;\">Node.js Stream</h3></div><div style=\"margin-top: 20px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 8px;\">記憶體使用</div><div style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #EF4444;\">~50-100MB</div><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px;\">(1GB 檔案)</div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 8px;\">上下文切換</div><div style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #EF4444;\">1000+</div></div></div></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 2px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; position: relative; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); transition: all 0.3s ease;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: 12px; right: 12px; background-color: #FFB800; color: #000; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">最佳</div><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #FFB800; box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.6);\"></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;\">Bun.file()</h3></div><div style=\"margin-top: 20px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 8px;\">記憶體使用</div><div style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 900; color: #FFB800; letter-spacing: -0.02em;\">0MB</div><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px;\">(零複製)</div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 8px;\">上下文切換</div><div style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 900; color: #FFB800; letter-spacing: -0.02em;\">1</div></div></div></div></div><h2>最佳實踐</h2><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px; margin: 24px 0;\"><ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 16px;\"><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 6px; transition: all 0.2s ease;\"><div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #FFB800; color: #000; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\">✓</div><div style=\"flex: 1;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px;\">始終檢查存在性</strong><span style=\"color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">在提供檔案前使用 <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 13px;\">await file.exists()</code></span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 6px; transition: all 0.2s ease;\"><div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #FFB800; color: #000; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\">✓</div><div style=\"flex: 1;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px;\">驗證路徑</strong><span style=\"color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">防止目錄遍歷攻擊</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 6px; transition: all 0.2s ease;\"><div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #FFB800; color: #000; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\">✓</div><div style=\"flex: 1;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px;\">設定 Content-Type</strong><span style=\"color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">明確設定 MIME 類型以獲得更好的瀏覽器處理</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 6px; transition: all 0.2s ease;\"><div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #FFB800; color: #000; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\">✓</div><div style=\"flex: 1;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px;\">使用 ETag</strong><span style=\"color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">實作條件請求以實現高效快取</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 6px; transition: all 0.2s ease;\"><div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #FFB800; color: #000; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\">✓</div><div style=\"flex: 1;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px;\">Range 支援</strong><span style=\"color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">讓 Bun 自動處理 Range 請求以進行影片串流</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 6px; transition: all 0.2s ease;\"><div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #FFB800; color: #000; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\">✓</div><div style=\"flex: 1;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px;\">安全標頭</strong><span style=\"color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">為檔案下載添加適當的安全標頭</span></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"callout-tip\"><p><strong>效能</strong>：零複製檔案串流是 Bun 的殺手級功能之一。對於提供大型媒體檔案，這種方法相比傳統的 Node.js 串流方法提供 10-100 倍的更好效能，且零記憶體開銷。</p></div>",
